  "description": "What's more tragic than a play by Shakespeare? As far as high school junior Juliet Holiday is concerned, her real tragedy is sharing a name with such a famous character. Then along comes a charming British transfer student named none other than Romeo. Did fate lead him to this small Kansas town? Pray tell, who's the real Romeo in Juliet's story? \n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
